# project-viability

Apply the project-viability skill when the request matches its scope.

Capabilities:
- evaluate functional, architectural, and growth risks
- consume repository audit findings
- trace project viability decisions across inputs, constraints, and failure paths
- validate project outcomes with evidence, assumptions, and explicit next steps

Stop when: Pre-flight checks resolved; automated baseline completed; three parallel sub-agents executed; quality gate passed; Viability Assessment saved to .reports/; JSON structured result returned; completion criteria verified; user asked how to proceed.
